WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:05.105
Last weekend: what they did, and what they didn't do!

2
00:00:06.555 --> 00:00:09.805
Carlos wanted to go to the gym on Saturday.

3
00:00:10.255 --> 00:00:14.435
But he didn't go to the gym. He slept all day!

4
00:00:16.685 --> 00:00:19.657
We didn't go to the beach on Sunday. It was cold.

5
00:00:20.107 --> 00:00:22.104
We went cycling with our friends.

6
00:00:24.354 --> 00:00:27.651
Grandma Rosa didn't buy bread at the bakery.

7
00:00:28.101 --> 00:00:31.584
She made it at home, and it was delicious!

8
00:00:33.834 --> 00:00:36.714
Ana didn't watch TV on Saturday night.

9
00:00:37.164 --> 00:00:39.253
She read a book on the sofa.

10
00:00:41.503 --> 00:00:46.147
And me? I didn't see my friends last weekend. I worked all weekend!

11
00:00:48.397 --> 00:00:53.413
And you? Tell me something you didn't do last weekend!

